{"from": "site:caesarea-maritima", "type": "attests", "to": "claim:ac-12-19-caesarea", "grade": "B", "note": "The excavated Herodian port city attests the setting of Agrippa's stay in his capital; the stay itself is Josephus's account (Ant. 19.343-350, grade A on this claim)."}
